WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.540
In the field there is not always signal. For the system, that is not a problem.

2
00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:10.640
The field worker takes a photo of the signed attendance list.

3
00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:16.230
Artificial intelligence straightens it, reads it and checks it against the declared totals.

4
00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:24.740
Before saving, the phone checks whether each person was already served. Offline, and without storing names on the device.

5
00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:29.200
Everything stays on the phone, with date, time and location.

6
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:35.190
When the signal comes back, it uploads by itself. If it retries, nothing is duplicated.

7
00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:39.550
The coordination team reviews, corrects if needed and approves.

8
00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:46.140
And the monthly dashboard updates: new people, progress against target and the source of every figure.

9
00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:50.140
From the field to the dashboard, without typing anything twice.

